<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#outcome-ire-owo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iré Owó (wealth)"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#prescribedWork> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The ebó, rogation, ceremony, or spiritual work prescribed as a result of this reading. Range: iroko:EboTypeScheme. Among the most sensitive data: links divination outcome to specific prescribed action."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#outcome-ire> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iré"@yo .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ebo-sacrifice> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sacrificio animal"@es .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#verseSource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Provenance of this verse record: oral transmission, field recording, published collection. Range: iroko:DocumentaryEvidence."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#DivinationVerse> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#SacredEntity> .
