<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#medium-okuele> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Okuele / Ekuele (divining chain)"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#governingEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-marca> .
