<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#outcome-ire-are> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Iré of victory or achievement. The sign comes with the blessing of success in endeavor."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ebo-cleansing> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Limpieza espiritual"@es .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#EboTypeScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Tipos de trabalho prescrito"@pt .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#outcome-ire> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iré (positivo)"@es .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#DivinationSystemScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#system-obi> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#OutcomeTypeScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Divination Outcome Types"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#primarySign> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In composite systems (Ifá), the sign generated by the first cast. The primary odù of a compound figure."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#system-ifa> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ifá"@yo .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#signTaboo> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
