<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#outcome-ire-owo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Iré of prosperity. The sign comes with the blessing of material abundance."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ebo-etutu> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#EboTypeScheme> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#primarySign> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "primary sign"@en .
