<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#medium-ikin> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Ikin (palm nuts)"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#outcome-osogbo-ojú> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Osogbo Ojú (enmity)"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ebo-adimú> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Adimú"@es .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#signReceived> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The divination sign(s) that appeared in this reading."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#outcome-osogbo-ojú> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#readingDate> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#secondarySign> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In composite systems (Ifá), the sign generated by the second cast. Together with primarySign, identifies the full odù compound."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#medium-obi-kola> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#CastingMediumScheme> .
