<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ebo-ebo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A prescribed offering to the Orisha or Ifá indicated by the reading. Includes specific materials, animals, foods, or objects. Operational details are initiated-only."@en .
