<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#OutcomeTypeScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Àwọn ìrú àbájáde aṣọtẹ́lẹ̀"@yo .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ebo-etutu> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Itutu / Etutu"@en .
