<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#outcome-ire-aiku> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Iré of long life. The sign comes with the blessing of longevity."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#signNumber> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#DivinationSign> .
