<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#medium-chamalongo-coconut> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Four coconut shell halves prepared and consecrated for Chamalongo divination in Palo traditions."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#EboTypeScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ebo-etutu> .
