<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#verseLineage> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The ile or lineage corpus from which this verse version derives. Different lineages may hold different versions of verses for the same sign."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#prescribedEntity> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#minimumAccessLevel> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#access-initiated-only> .
