<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#medium-cowrie> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sixteen cowrie shells used in Dilogún divination by authorized Olorisha."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#DivinationSystemScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#system-ita> .
