<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#medium-ikin> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sacred palm nuts (ikin Ifá, obi Ifá) used by Babalawos for Ifá divination. Considered the highest-authority casting medium in Lucumí/Yorùbá tradition."@en .
