<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#system-derle> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Card-based or object-based divination associated with Espiritismo and Haitian Vodou mesa blanca practice. Distinct from African-derived binary casting systems."@en .
