<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#authorizedPractitioner> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The authority title required to cast this system. In Ifá: Babalawo. In Dilogún: Olorisha with dilogún authorization. In Fá: Bokonon. Range: iroko:AuthorityTitleScheme."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#system-vititi-nfinda> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Vititi Nfinda"@en .
