<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#outcome-ire-omo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Iré Omo (children)"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#governingEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The spirit or deity principally associated with this sign across the tradition. In Ifá: Ogbe Meji is governed by Obatala; Oshé Meji by Oshun. This is a tradition-level association, not reading-specific. Range: iroko:SpiritualEntity."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ebo-adimú> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#hasCorpus> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "has corpus"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#OutcomeTypeScheme> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#outcome-ire-owo> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#readingOutcome> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Whether the sign came iré (positive polarity) or osogbo (negative polarity) in this reading. Range: iroko:OutcomeTypeScheme."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-marca> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-marca/1.3.0> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ebo-abstention> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Abstention / Prohibition"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#medium-okuele> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#authorizedPractitioner> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#verseTheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#minimumAccessLevel> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#access-initiated-only> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#DivinationCorpus> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#outcome-ire-omo> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Iré of children or generativity. The sign comes with the blessing of progeny or creative fruitfulness."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#outcome-osogbo-ojú> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Osogbo of enemies or opposition. The negative force indicated involves interpersonal conflict or hostility."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#verseTheme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Thematic summary of the verse's principal narrative or prescription, without reproducing the text. Initiated-only."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#DivinationSystemScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#ebo-abstention> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#EboTypeScheme> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#readingDate> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "reading date"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#medium-obi-coconut> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Obi Abata (coconut)"@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#DivinationReading> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A specific divination event performed for a recipient by an authorized diviner. Records the sign(s) that appeared, the outcome polarity (iré/osogbo), prescribed works, and the entities indicated. Reading records are among the most sensitive data in the framework: recipient identity is no-access; the date and officiant are community-restricted; the prescribed work and entity are initiated-only."@en .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#CastingMediumScheme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#prescribedEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko-marca> .
<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#medium-cowrie> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Owó Dilogún (cowrie shells)"@en .
